Description: backup program with deduplication and encryption
 restic is a backup program that is fast, efficient and secure. It
 deduplicates data at the chunk level, so unchanged content is never stored
 twice, and encrypts and authenticates everything on the client before it
 leaves the machine.
 .
 Backups can be stored on a local directory, SFTP, HTTP REST, Amazon S3 and
 S3-compatible services, OpenStack Swift, Backblaze B2, Microsoft Azure Blob
 Storage, Google Cloud Storage, or anything rclone can reach. Snapshots are
 append-only and can be mounted as a filesystem for browsing and restoring
 individual files.
